  "name": "CPK - BB FRACTION",
  "code": "2717",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<h2 id=\"interpretation\" class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-base font-[500] first:mt-0 md:text-lg dark:font-[475] [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\"></h2>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Normal CK-BB (&lt;0.6% of total CK):</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Indicates no significant injury to the brain, lungs, or other smooth muscle tissues<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Elevated CK-BB (&gt;0.6% or above lab range):</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Suggests possible&nbsp;<strong>brain injury</strong>&nbsp;(trauma, stroke, bleeding),&nbsp;<strong>seizure</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>brain tumor</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong>pulmonary infarction</strong>&nbsp;(lung tissue death).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">Additional causes may include electroconvulsive therapy or metastatic cancer involving the brain or lung tissue</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
